- VALUES ('HTH_API_PWD_CODE_USER_EMAIL_en','EMAIL','HTH_API_PWD_CODE_USER_EMAIL_en','HTH_API_PASSWORD_CODE_APPROVED_USER_EMAIL_EVENT',TO_CLOB('<p>Dear Valued Customer,</p><p> </p> <p>Thank you for choosing BEA. You can now set up your BEA H2H API password by following the steps below:</p><p> </p> <p> 1. Visit the Bank''s website.</p><p> </p> <p> 2. Select "Hong Kong - BEA Corporate Online".</p><p> </p> <p> 3. Log in to BEA Corporate Online using your User ID and Password.</p><p> </p> <p> 4. Click "Set Up H2H API Password" from the pop-up reminder, or click "Profile" at the top right corner and select "H2H API Password".</p><p> </p> <p> 5. Enter "New Password", "Confirm New Password" and the 6-digit "H2H API Password Setup Code" provided by an Authorised Signer or System Administrator for verification.</p><p> </p> <p> Please note that the H2H API Password Setup Code is valid for 24 hours after approval.</p><p> </p> <p> For enquiries, please call our Merchant Services Hotline on (852) 2211 1056 during office hours.</p><p> </p> <p>=======================================================================</p><p> </p> <p> Yours faithfully,</p><p> </p> <p> The Bank of East Asia, Limited</p><p> </p> <p> If there are any discrepancies between the English and Chinese versions of this email, the English version shall apply and prevail. This is a system-generated email – please do not  reply to this email or via any hyperlinks in the message.</p><p> </p> <p>=======================================================================</p><p> </p> <p> 尊貴的客戶：</p><p> </p> <p> 感謝選用東亞銀行。閣下現可按照以下步驟設定東亞銀行H2H API密碼：</p><p> </p> <p> 1. 瀏覽本行網站。</p><p> </p> <p> 2. 選擇「香港 - 東亞企業網上銀行」。</p><p> </p> <p> 3. 輸入用戶識別碼及密碼登入東亞企業網上銀行。</p><p> </p> <p> 4. 於彈窗提示中按「設置H2H API密碼」，或按右上角的「簡介」後點擊「H2H API密碼」。</p><p> </p> <p> 5. 輸入「新密碼」、「確認新密碼」及由獲授權人士或系統管理員提供的 6 位數字「H2H API密碼設定碼」以完成驗證。</p><p> </p> <p>請注意，H2H API密碼設定碼於審批後 24 小時失效。</p><p> </p> <p>如有垂詢，請致電本行：(852) 2211 1321。</p><p> </p> <p>感謝使用本行服務。</p><p> </p> <p>=======================================================================</p><p> </p> <p>謹啓</p><p> </p> <p>東亞銀行有限公司</p><p> </p> <p>中英文本文義如有歧異，概以英文本為準。此乃電腦系統發出之電郵，請勿回覆此電郵和電郵內的超連結。</p>'),USER,SYSDATE,USER,SYSDATE,1,'A',TO_CLOB('BEA Corporate Online : H2H API Password Setup Code Approved 東亞企業網上銀行：銀企直連密碼設定碼已獲批准'),'CZ','OBDX_BU');
